    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6096" root="جلح" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَلِّحٌ</span></b>  A man (S) <i>who eats much; a great
eater; voracious.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْلَاحٌ</span>.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَةٌ مُجَلِّحَةٌ</span> <i>A year of drought, barrenness,</i>
or <i>death.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>Insolent and audacious.</i>
(L.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ وَقِحٌ مُجَلِّحٌ</span> [<i>Such a one is
impudent, insolent, and audacious</i>]. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
A <i>bold</i> wolf. (TA.)

